1) Create Custom VPC ✅ 

VPC Name: My-VPC-02
CIDR: 10.0.0.0/16

Purpose: Create a dedicated AWS network for the project.

Activities Performed:

• Created My-VPC-02
• Assigned CIDR 10.0.0.0/16
• Created dedicated network space for Public and Private Subnets

Outcome:
✔ Custom VPC created successfully.

📝 Notes:
VPC acts as the network boundary.
All resources in the project are deployed inside this VPC.

