Association: Private-Subnet-02

↓

Private-RT-02

Purpose: Ensure the Private Subnet remains isolated from direct Internet access.

Outcome:
✔ Private Route Table associated successfully.
✔ Private-Subnet-02 became a Private Subnet.
✔ No direct Internet access.

